                              <DEFINITION-REF DEST="ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF">/MICROSAR/EcuM/EcuMConfiguration/EcuMCommonConfiguration/EcuMDriverInitListOne/EcuMDriverInitItem/EcuMModuleID</DEFINITION-REF>
